# Vendored map libraries are committed verbatim so a checkout can be verified against the
# upstream release (e.g. md5sum against MapLibre's dist.zip or unpkg's leaflet-global.js).
#
# The committed blobs already match upstream byte for byte. What breaks verification is
# core.autocrlf, which rewrites them to CRLF on checkout, so every locally computed hash
# disagrees with upstream even though the repo content is correct. `-text` disables that
# conversion in both directions and leaves the blobs untouched.
#
# Only third-party bundles belong here. Our own page, visits-map.html, is ordinary text and
# is deliberately not listed.
app/src/main/assets/map/maplibre/maplibre-gl*.mjs -text
app/src/main/assets/map/maplibre/maplibre-gl.css  -text
app/src/main/assets/map/leaflet/leaflet-*.js      -text
app/src/main/assets/map/leaflet/leaflet-*.css     -text
